  "body": "Hey there,\r\n\r\nafter I migrated to a new server (Ubuntu 18.04.01 with Postgres 10.9) the server won't start.\r\nI've installed matrix-synapse via apt, so I use the prebuild ubuntu packages.\r\n\r\n```\r\nJul 17 20:21:58 ServerName systemd[1]: Started Synapse Matrix homeserver.\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\nFile \"/usr/lib/python2.7/runpy.py\", line 174, in _run_module_as_main \"__main__\", fname, loader, pkg_name)\r\nFile \"/usr/lib/python2.7/runpy.py\", line 72, in _run_code exec code in run_globals\r\nFile \"/usr/lib/python2.7/dist-packages/synapse/app/homeserver.py\", line 449, in <module> main()\r\nFile \"/usr/lib/python2.7/dist-packages/synapse/app/homeserver.py\", line 444, in main hs = setup(sys.argv[1:])\r\nFile \"/usr/lib/python2.7/dist-packages/synapse/app/homeserver.py\", line 305, in setup \r\nFile \"/usr/lib/python2.7/dist-packages/synapse/storage/prepare_database.py\", line 62, in prepare_database cur, user_version, delta_files, upgraded, database_engine, config\r\nFile \"/usr/lib/python2.7/dist-packages/synapse/storage/prepare_database.py\", line 202, in _upgrade_existing_database \"new for the server to understand\"\r\nValueError: Cannot use this database as it is too new for the server to understand\r\nMain process exited, code=exited, status=1/FAILURE\r\nFailed with result 'exit-code'.\r\n```\r\nIs there an script which can help me to fix his problem?\r\n\r\nRegards\r\n\r\nRobert",
